37
00:02:08,270 --> 00:02:13,150
Episode 26:
Phantom Goal

38
00:02:08,270 --> 00:02:13,150
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
www.areyousuresubs.com

39
00:02:09,060 --> 00:02:13,440
Nankatsu captain Ozora Tsubasa-kun dribbles into Meiwa's half.

40
00:02:13,440 --> 00:02:15,190
Go! Get it back!

41
00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:17,780
Listen, Tsubasa.

42
00:02:17,780 --> 00:02:20,360
I'll support your injured left leg with a bandage.

43
00:02:20,360 --> 00:02:23,070
That way you won't feel too much pain.

44
00:02:23,070 --> 00:02:25,870
This way you'll be able to run and shoot as you want.

45
00:02:26,420 --> 00:02:32,020
But because of the bandage, ball control will be harder than usual.

46
00:02:32,020 --> 00:02:32,920
Okay.

47
00:02:32,920 --> 00:02:33,670
Take it!

48
00:02:35,130 --> 00:02:37,800
Meiwa's sliding squad attacks!

49
00:02:39,550 --> 00:02:40,300
What?!

50
00:02:40,300 --> 00:02:45,220
Tsubasa-kun controls the ball with his right leg instead of his just-injured left leg!

51
00:02:45,220 --> 00:02:47,140
Very skillful footwork.

52
00:02:47,140 --> 00:02:48,050
Perfect!

53
00:02:48,050 --> 00:02:49,640
You're doing great, Tsubasa-kun!

54
00:02:50,640 --> 00:02:51,260
There!

55
00:02:51,260 --> 00:02:51,870
What?!

56
00:02:51,870 --> 00:02:53,690
Tsubasa-kun shoots.

57
00:02:53,690 --> 00:02:55,520
I won't let you score!

58
00:02:56,820 --> 00:03:01,200
Rather than a shot, it was a pass for Misaki-kun!

59
00:03:01,200 --> 00:03:03,780
Misaki-kun jumps and heads it!

60
00:03:03,780 --> 00:03:04,580
He did it!

61
00:03:04,580 --> 00:03:06,370
We tricked Meiwa again!

62
00:03:07,960 --> 00:03:10,330
Wakashimazu-kun stops it!

63
00:03:10,330 --> 00:03:11,330
What?!

64
00:03:13,870 --> 00:03:15,460
That was close, huh.

65
00:03:16,090 --> 00:03:17,570
Did he figure it out?

66
00:03:18,460 --> 00:03:20,320
That's to be expected from Wakashimazu-kun.

67
00:03:20,320 --> 00:03:23,430
He's not falling for the same mistake twice.

68
00:03:24,430 --> 00:03:27,700
It was Wakashimazu-kun, wasn't it?

69
00:03:27,700 --> 00:03:30,560
Wakashimazu Ken-kun.

70
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:32,310
Very good.

71
00:03:32,310 --> 00:03:33,770
Hyuga-san!

72
00:03:33,770 --> 00:03:35,020
This time...

73
00:03:35,020 --> 00:03:37,110
...I'll score!

74
00:03:37,110 --> 00:03:38,020
Wakabayashi-kun!

75
00:03:43,650 --> 00:03:44,660
Damn it!

76
00:03:44,660 --> 00:03:46,410
Nice, Wakabayashi-kun!

77
00:03:46,410 --> 00:03:48,120
Go!

78
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:52,350
Both Wakashimazu-kun and Wakabayashi-kun are very good.

79
00:03:52,350 --> 00:03:56,630
Who will score the first goal in extra time?

80
00:03:56,630 --> 00:04:00,590
Both are attacking, but the flow of the match ends in defense.

81
00:04:00,590 --> 00:04:02,510
There! At the goal!

82
00:04:02,510 --> 00:04:03,840
Tsubasa-kun...

83
00:04:05,130 --> 00:04:06,430
Misaki-kun!

84
00:04:06,430 --> 00:04:08,710
The ball reaches Tsubasa-kun!

85
00:04:08,710 --> 00:04:10,930
Tsubasa-kun jumps and volleys it!

86
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:25,650
Look at that!

87
00:04:25,650 --> 00:04:29,080
Wakashimazu-kun plays wonderfully!

88
00:04:29,080 --> 00:04:31,200
What was that?!

89
00:04:31,200 --> 00:04:32,450
Damn.

90
00:04:34,330 --> 00:04:36,640
Look at the intensity of this match.

91
00:04:36,640 --> 00:04:38,700
It's so hot I'm going to faint.

92
00:04:38,700 --> 00:04:41,380
Everyone is amazing. Truly amazing.

93
00:04:41,380 --> 00:04:44,050
Yes, amazing...

94
00:04:44,050 --> 00:04:47,220
Both teams are continuing even though they're very tired.

95
00:04:47,220 --> 00:04:49,850
They've been chasing the ball since extra time began.

96
00:04:53,770 --> 00:04:56,150
What happened to Misaki-kun?!

97
00:04:56,150 --> 00:04:59,270
He collapsed on the ground, clutching his leg!

98
00:05:00,020 --> 00:05:01,770
Misaki-kun can't move!

99
00:05:01,770 --> 00:05:03,360
Alright, here's the chance!

100
00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:04,570
Take this!

101
00:05:04,570 --> 00:05:06,820
Damn it. Come on if you're coming.

102
00:05:06,820 --> 00:05:11,530
If you all gather around me, Tsubasa-kun will be free!

103
00:05:11,530 --> 00:05:12,540
Misaki-kun!

104
00:05:13,290 --> 00:05:16,500
Misaki-kun sends a wonderful pass just in time!

105
00:05:20,840 --> 00:05:21,590
Misaki!

106
00:05:24,460 --> 00:05:28,220
He put his own leg on the line just to pass to me!

107
00:05:29,580 --> 00:05:32,140
I'll score the goal, Misaki-kun!

108
00:05:34,310 --> 00:05:36,760
Tsubasa-kun performs his special move for the third time today!

109
00:05:36,760 --> 00:05:38,810
Overhead kick!

110
00:05:38,810 --> 00:05:41,690
Take this, Wakashimazu!

111
00:05:41,690 --> 00:05:42,940
Go!

112
00:05:44,900 --> 00:05:46,190
Stop it!

113
00:05:46,940 --> 00:05:49,070
No matter how powerful your shot is, it doesn't matter!

114
00:05:49,070 --> 00:05:51,570
Long shots don't work on me!

115
00:05:52,620 --> 00:05:53,580
What?!

116
00:05:54,140 --> 00:06:00,580
He reaches Tsubasa-kun's shot, but Wakashimazu-kun can't catch it!

117
00:06:04,090 --> 00:06:08,220
Tsubasa-kun's overhead kick put so much rotation on the ball...

118
00:06:08,220 --> 00:06:13,740
...and the ball Wakashimazu-kun barely reached bounced into the goal!

119
00:06:13,740 --> 00:06:18,240
But at the same time, the referee also blew the whistle to end the first half!

120
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:20,520
Will this goal be accepted?

121
00:06:20,520 --> 00:06:21,520
Referee!

122
00:06:21,520 --> 00:06:23,770
Is it a goal or not?!

123
00:06:27,490 --> 00:06:28,860
No goal!

124
00:06:30,490 --> 00:06:32,110
No goal?!

125
00:06:35,400 --> 00:06:37,160
Is this serious?!

126
00:06:37,160 --> 00:06:40,390
The referee didn't count the goal.

127
00:06:40,390 --> 00:06:43,960
The first half ends goalless.

128
00:06:44,640 --> 00:06:46,130
Damn it!

129
00:06:48,800 --> 00:06:49,760
Misaki!

130
00:06:49,760 --> 00:06:50,520
Are you okay?

131
00:06:50,520 --> 00:06:51,640
Misaki!

132
00:06:51,640 --> 00:06:54,140
I'm fine. I can play in the second half too.

133
00:06:54,140 --> 00:06:55,680
Here, hold on.

134
00:06:57,400 --> 00:06:59,810
I'm sorry. I couldn't score.

135
00:06:59,810 --> 00:07:01,810
No problem.

136
00:07:01,810 --> 00:07:03,940
Misaki-kun...

137
00:07:15,640 --> 00:07:18,600
Whoever scores within 5 minutes will win.

138
00:07:18,600 --> 00:07:19,700
Yes.

139
00:07:19,700 --> 00:07:24,790
Since goalkeepers aren't as tired as the other players, everything will come down to a single goal.

140
00:07:24,790 --> 00:07:28,570
But do you think a goal will be scored to finish the match?

141
00:07:28,570 --> 00:07:29,700
It will!

142
00:07:29,700 --> 00:07:34,000
Both teams have the strength to play for 5 more minutes.

143
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:38,100
So they'll tie all their hopes to this second half.

144
00:07:38,100 --> 00:07:41,850
I can't predict at all who will win.

145
00:07:41,850 --> 00:07:42,810
Yes.

146
00:07:42,810 --> 00:07:46,770
The second extra time half is about to begin!

147
00:07:46,770 --> 00:07:48,770
Do your best, Taro.

148
00:07:48,770 --> 00:07:51,030
You promised, Misaki.

149
00:07:51,030 --> 00:07:56,170
When you feel like you can't play or when you reach your limit...

150
00:07:56,170 --> 00:07:59,030
...you'll voluntarily withdraw from the field.

151
00:08:03,040 --> 00:08:08,800
Tsubasa-kun, the first match we played together also had extra time, didn't it?

152
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:11,420
Yes, exactly.

153
00:08:14,050 --> 00:08:16,710
I'm coming, Hyuga Kojiro!

154
00:08:19,060 --> 00:08:24,060
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
www.areyousuresubs.com

155
00:08:24,980 --> 00:08:28,110
The second half of extra time begins.

156
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:31,780
Nankatsu captain Tsubasa-kun advances in the opponent's half.

157
00:08:31,780 --> 00:08:33,320
This time we'll stop him!

158
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:34,150
Yes!

159
00:08:34,150 --> 00:08:37,120
This time we'll do our best to fill Misaki's place!

160
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:37,910
Yes!

161
00:08:37,910 --> 00:08:42,660
Under the gaze of the huge crowd, time continues to tick away.

162
00:08:42,660 --> 00:08:48,670
Who will emerge smiling from this fierce derby between Nankatsu and Meiwa?

163
00:08:48,670 --> 00:08:51,420
Predicting the winner is completely impossible.

164
00:08:52,130 --> 00:08:54,920
Tsubasa-kun fights giving it everything he has!

165
00:08:54,920 --> 00:08:57,090
While both sides are looking for a goal opportunity...

166
00:08:57,090 --> 00:09:00,300
...Tsubasa-kun fires a long-range shot with all his might.

167
00:09:00,880 --> 00:09:03,380
Wakashimazu-kun catches it.

168
00:09:03,380 --> 00:09:04,420
Captain!

169
00:09:04,420 --> 00:09:07,310
Right now, no one but you can score for Meiwa!

170
00:09:07,310 --> 00:09:08,580
Alright.

171
00:09:09,480 --> 00:09:10,380
Big brother!

172
00:09:10,380 --> 00:09:11,610
Do your best!

173
00:09:11,610 --> 00:09:14,740
This time Hyuga-kun dribbles into Nankatsu's half.

174
00:09:14,740 --> 00:09:16,030
Damn it!

175
00:09:16,670 --> 00:09:18,820
Hyuga-kun also fires a long shot.

176
00:09:19,530 --> 00:09:23,950
But Nankatsu goalkeeper Wakabayashi-kun is not someone who concedes easily.

177
00:09:23,950 --> 00:09:24,780
Damn it!

178
00:09:24,780 --> 00:09:30,250
Even the star players who score in every match can't prevent their fatigue from showing on their faces.

179
00:09:30,250 --> 00:09:34,170
The energy of both goalkeepers seems to be quite high.

180
00:09:34,170 --> 00:09:36,670
The ball comes to Tsubasa-kun again.

181
00:09:36,670 --> 00:09:37,650
Brazil...

182
00:09:37,650 --> 00:09:39,800
I'll win and go to Brazil.

183
00:09:39,800 --> 00:09:42,810
To the football country of Brazil with Roberto...

184
00:09:42,810 --> 00:09:47,230
I'll become the number one football player in the world!

185
00:09:47,230 --> 00:09:48,960
I won't lose!

186
00:09:48,960 --> 00:09:51,230
I'll win and enter Toho Academy and...

187
00:09:51,230 --> 00:09:55,740
...offer my family a happy life with my own hard work!

188
00:10:00,160 --> 00:10:04,160
Tsubasa-kun and Hyuga-kun engage in a struggle for the ball again!

189
00:10:05,160 --> 00:10:09,670
Damn it! Just when I need to go help Tsubasa-kun...

190
00:10:09,670 --> 00:10:13,420
Damn it! I'll help Hyuga-san... I'll help Hyuga-san!

191
00:10:13,420 --> 00:10:15,920
We are at the climax of the grand final!

192
00:10:15,920 --> 00:10:20,680
Will it be Nankatsu or Meiwa who seizes the last chance and becomes champion?

193
00:10:20,680 --> 00:10:22,340
Do your best, Tsubasa!

194
00:10:22,340 --> 00:10:24,340
Don't lose the ball to Hyuga!

195
00:10:30,060 --> 00:10:31,350
I'll help Tsubasa-kun--

196
00:10:32,730 --> 00:10:33,900
My leg...

197
00:10:33,900 --> 00:10:35,360
Hyuga-san!

198
00:10:36,110 --> 00:10:37,420
Alright.

199
00:10:37,420 --> 00:10:41,360
Taking advantage of a moment of inattention, Hyuga-kun gets the ball.

200
00:10:42,680 --> 00:10:44,030
Damn it!

201
00:10:49,460 --> 00:10:50,620
Tsubasa-kun...

202
00:10:55,020 --> 00:10:58,200
Both trip and fall to the ground!

203
00:10:58,200 --> 00:11:00,260
The ball passes midfield.

204
00:11:01,370 --> 00:11:05,390
Big brother! Grit your teeth! You've almost made it!

205
00:11:05,390 --> 00:11:07,390
You guys...

206
00:11:08,890 --> 00:11:09,920
The ball is Meiwa's!

207
00:11:09,920 --> 00:11:10,980
Hyuga-san!

208
00:11:10,980 --> 00:11:12,090
Takeshi.

209
00:11:14,980 --> 00:11:16,020
Tsubasa.

210
00:11:16,020 --> 00:11:17,190
Hyuga-san!

211
00:11:24,500 --> 00:11:27,700
Has Tsubasa-kun run out of energy?!

212
00:11:27,700 --> 00:11:28,540
Tsubasa!

213
00:11:28,540 --> 00:11:31,410
It looks like Meiwa will seize the last chance!

214
00:11:31,410 --> 00:11:33,210
Big brother!

215
00:11:33,210 --> 00:11:34,710
Watch, everyone!

216
00:11:34,710 --> 00:11:37,720
I will put an end to this match!

217
00:11:37,720 --> 00:11:39,810
Do you think we'll allow it?!

218
00:11:39,810 --> 00:11:42,590
We'll stop it by putting our bodies on the line!

219
00:11:42,590 --> 00:11:43,720
Yes!

220
00:11:54,520 --> 00:11:55,480
Hyuga-kun!

221
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:57,070
What a feint!

222
00:11:57,070 --> 00:12:00,990
Hyuga-kun runs towards victory, putting his pride aside!

223
00:12:00,990 --> 00:12:03,990
Does he still have this much energy?!

224
00:12:06,350 --> 00:12:09,030
He loses his balance and falls!

225
00:12:09,030 --> 00:12:10,700
We have no other chance!

226
00:12:11,950 --> 00:12:14,120
You did it, Ishizaki!

227
00:12:16,290 --> 00:12:18,540
Not yet, Hyuga-san!

228
00:12:18,540 --> 00:12:23,940
Hyuga-san, this is truly the last pass I can make to you!

229
00:12:24,800 --> 00:12:25,910
Takeshi!

230
00:12:25,910 --> 00:12:28,800
The ball is above Hyuga-kun's head.

231
00:12:28,800 --> 00:12:32,280
Takeshi, I promised you, didn't I?

232
00:12:32,280 --> 00:12:34,460
We would become champions together.

233
00:12:34,460 --> 00:12:35,550
Exactly.

234
00:12:35,550 --> 00:12:37,560
As long as you pass to me...

235
00:12:37,560 --> 00:12:39,560
...I will definitely shoot!

236
00:12:43,070 --> 00:12:50,330
This... Hyuga-kun reaches for the championship with an overhead kick!

237
00:12:50,330 --> 00:12:54,890
If I let him score now, what did we come all this way for?

238
00:12:54,890 --> 00:12:58,790
What did everyone fight so hard for?

239
00:12:58,790 --> 00:13:00,320
Take this, Wakabayashi!

240
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:03,260
We will be the champions!

241
00:13:06,340 --> 00:13:09,180
H-He saved it!

242
00:13:09,180 --> 00:13:10,260
Genzo!

243
00:13:14,200 --> 00:13:16,270
I protected it, everyone.

244
00:13:16,270 --> 00:13:17,900
Wakabayashi-kun!

245
00:13:19,140 --> 00:13:23,830
And the whistle blows to end the extra time!

246
00:13:23,830 --> 00:13:26,150
I-It's time for additional extra time!

247
00:13:26,150 --> 00:13:29,050
In the finals of the National Youth Football Tournament...

248
00:13:29,050 --> 00:13:32,920
...the Nankatsu-Meiwa match could not be concluded in extra time.

249
00:13:32,920 --> 00:13:36,230
The match will continue with additional extra time.

250
00:13:36,230 --> 00:13:40,330
If the match still hasn't reached a conclusion, there will be no more extra time.

251
00:13:40,330 --> 00:13:42,040
There will be no penalty shootout either.

252
00:13:42,040 --> 00:13:44,800
Both teams will be declared champions.

253
00:13:45,380 --> 00:13:47,300
The players are very tired.

254
00:13:47,300 --> 00:13:49,960
Let them just declare both teams champions.

255
00:13:52,810 --> 00:13:54,510
It was a good match, huh.

256
00:13:55,390 --> 00:13:57,310
Taro...

257
00:13:57,310 --> 00:14:03,690
If both teams become champions, who will you choose between Hyuga-kun and Tsubasa-kun?

258
00:14:05,960 --> 00:14:09,360
Don't worry. I've already made my decision.

259
00:14:13,120 --> 00:14:17,250
The time for the final to end is near now, Tsubasa.

260
00:14:17,250 --> 00:14:20,880
Your father believes you will win.

261
00:14:20,880 --> 00:14:26,630
You'll be there when the happiness of the championship reflects on your face.

262
00:14:26,630 --> 00:14:33,260
In Japan, behind the rainbow left by the rain.

263
00:14:45,090 --> 00:14:46,530
It's raining!

264
00:14:48,030 --> 00:14:49,150
It's raining!

265
00:14:49,150 --> 00:14:50,700
Rain...

266
00:15:09,760 --> 00:15:12,060
It rained well, huh.

267
00:15:12,060 --> 00:15:12,760
Yes.

268
00:15:12,760 --> 00:15:16,260
I've gathered the energy to finish the match.

269
00:15:16,260 --> 00:15:20,180
We couldn't get any more extra time in the interschool tournament.

270
00:15:20,180 --> 00:15:23,120
So our battle couldn't reach a conclusion, Tsubasa.

271
00:15:23,990 --> 00:15:26,110
If that tournament had gone on longer...

272
00:15:26,110 --> 00:15:29,530
...I'm sure Nankatsu would have won.

273
00:15:29,530 --> 00:15:31,420
What are you drinking, Ishizaki?

274
00:15:31,420 --> 00:15:35,200
After you injured your leg, you couldn't even play.

275
00:15:35,200 --> 00:15:36,960
Exactly.

276
00:15:36,960 --> 00:15:41,620
In that match, Kishida and I fought to replace Ishizaki.

277
00:15:41,620 --> 00:15:44,460
In the end, Misaki appeared though.

278
00:15:44,460 --> 00:15:48,210
Tsubasa and Misaki's golden duo was formed then.

279
00:15:48,210 --> 00:15:51,680
Kids, you just have to do your best for 10 more minutes.

280
00:15:51,680 --> 00:15:54,470
If it ends in a draw again this time, both teams will be champions.

281
00:15:54,470 --> 00:15:57,140
We can't accept that, Coach.

282
00:15:57,140 --> 00:15:58,180
Tsubasa...

283
00:15:58,180 --> 00:16:01,150
We lost to Meiwa in the first match.

284
00:16:01,150 --> 00:16:03,690
So we have no choice but to win this match!

285
00:16:03,690 --> 00:16:06,690
Otherwise, we can't call ourselves champions!

286
00:16:12,860 --> 00:16:14,200
We have no choice but to attack.

287
00:16:14,200 --> 00:16:15,700
What?

288
00:16:15,700 --> 00:16:19,190
Meiwa's football is based on winning.

289
00:16:19,190 --> 00:16:21,340
We don't aim for draws.

290
00:16:21,340 --> 00:16:23,740
So this is the only option.

291
00:16:23,740 --> 00:16:25,330
Isn't that right, Coach?

292
00:16:25,330 --> 00:16:28,920
Yes. The meaning of being a champion is clear.

293
00:16:28,920 --> 00:16:32,590
No matter what, Meiwa must take this!

294
00:16:32,590 --> 00:16:38,160
The football god must have sent that rain just now so everyone could rest.

295
00:16:38,160 --> 00:16:40,390
I think so too.

296
00:16:41,220 --> 00:16:42,680
Tsubasa-kun.

297
00:16:42,680 --> 00:16:49,150
I feel like if I keep playing, I'll be a burden to everyone.

298
00:16:49,150 --> 00:16:52,120
Does your leg hurt that much?

299
00:16:52,120 --> 00:16:54,220
The pain in my leg is fine.

300
00:16:54,220 --> 00:16:57,410
Even if my leg were broken, I'd play in this half.

301
00:16:57,410 --> 00:17:00,330
But with my current playing style, to everyone...

302
00:17:00,330 --> 00:17:01,910
What are you saying?

303
00:17:01,910 --> 00:17:07,500
Without you just now, it would have been impossible for me to get the ball at my feet against Wakashimazu-kun!

304
00:17:07,500 --> 00:17:08,380
But...

305
00:17:08,380 --> 00:17:15,930
Exactly. Against Wakashimazu, no one but Nankatsu's golden duo, Tsubasa and Misaki, can score.

306
00:17:15,930 --> 00:17:17,800
I thought of something for that.

307
00:17:17,800 --> 00:17:20,070
We'll let the opponent attack in the first half.

308
00:17:20,070 --> 00:17:20,850
What?

309
00:17:20,850 --> 00:17:23,420
I want the two of you to rest.

310
00:17:23,420 --> 00:17:24,860
Wakabayashi-kun...

311
00:17:24,860 --> 00:17:27,730
Meanwhile, everyone else will play defense.

312
00:17:27,730 --> 00:17:31,730
No matter what, we will prevent Meiwa from scoring in this half.

313
00:17:31,730 --> 00:17:34,610
And we'll leave the second half to Tsubasa and Misaki.

314
00:17:34,610 --> 00:17:38,490
Alright! I can't think of any other plan to beat Meiwa!

315
00:17:39,170 --> 00:17:40,780
Let's do this, Misaki-kun.

316
00:17:40,780 --> 00:17:43,410
Okay. I'll use my last strength.

317
00:17:45,370 --> 00:17:48,870
10 minutes remain until the real final of the match.

318
00:17:48,870 --> 00:17:53,350
The first additional extra time will begin with Meiwa's kick-off.

319
00:17:53,350 --> 00:17:54,710
Alright. Attack!

320
00:17:54,710 --> 00:17:56,060
Okay!

321
00:17:57,050 --> 00:18:00,050
Everyone! Protect this place no matter what!

322
00:18:01,920 --> 00:18:03,100
There!

323
00:18:05,180 --> 00:18:07,180
Don't leave Hyuga unmarked!

324
00:18:08,270 --> 00:18:09,810
He's going to send it to Hyuga!

325
00:18:09,810 --> 00:18:11,010
Mark him!

326
00:18:12,690 --> 00:18:13,940
Hyuga-san!

327
00:18:13,940 --> 00:18:18,610
Sawada-kun and Hyuga-kun pass wonderfully, as if they've built a connection between them!

328
00:18:18,610 --> 00:18:19,490
We'll stop them!

329
00:18:19,490 --> 00:18:20,360
Yes!

330
00:18:24,370 --> 00:18:25,680
Damn it!

331
00:18:28,750 --> 00:18:30,250
Wakabayashi, keep it up!

332
00:18:32,080 --> 00:18:34,420
Hyuga-kun tries to pass through midfield!

333
00:18:39,930 --> 00:18:41,100
Damn it!

334
00:18:42,420 --> 00:18:45,140
Can the two of them stop Hyuga-kun?

335
00:18:46,740 --> 00:18:47,890
What?!

336
00:18:47,890 --> 00:18:49,820
How many times did you think you could get past us?!

337
00:18:49,820 --> 00:18:52,900
We are the Nankatsu defense!

338
00:18:58,140 --> 00:19:00,280
The Nankatsu defense succeeds!

339
00:19:00,280 --> 00:19:03,200
They stop Hyuga-kun wonderfully.

340
00:19:03,200 --> 00:19:05,090
Nice, Takasugi!

341
00:19:06,400 --> 00:19:08,700
Be careful! Mark Tsubasa and Misaki!

342
00:19:08,700 --> 00:19:09,710
Okay!

343
00:19:10,830 --> 00:19:11,830
Urabe!

344
00:19:12,770 --> 00:19:14,210
Did he trick me?

345
00:19:14,210 --> 00:19:15,340
Izawa!

346
00:19:17,430 --> 00:19:21,180
Nankatsu passes the ball among themselves.

347
00:19:21,870 --> 00:19:25,550
Star player Tsubasa-kun and Misaki-kun aren't budging.

348
00:19:25,550 --> 00:19:28,950
Why aren't Tsubasa and Misaki-kun moving?

349
00:19:28,950 --> 00:19:31,240
It must be Nankatsu's plan.

350
00:19:31,240 --> 00:19:34,310
They'll put everything on the line in the second half.

351
00:19:34,310 --> 00:19:37,980
The Nankatsu defense is very tight as usual.

352
00:19:37,980 --> 00:19:44,740
While brilliantly marking star players Hyuga-kun and Sawada-kun, they also block the shots of the other players.

353
00:19:44,740 --> 00:19:47,490
Even so, Meiwa constantly tries to shoot.

354
00:19:47,490 --> 00:19:51,290
However, only a few shots can reach Wakabayashi.

355
00:19:51,290 --> 00:19:53,040
This bastard...

356
00:19:53,040 --> 00:19:56,170
Wakabayashi-kun is like a guardian angel!

357
00:19:57,550 --> 00:20:01,340
My leg is also reaching its limit.

358
00:20:01,340 --> 00:20:04,970
Only a few minutes left. We'll endure somehow!

359
00:20:04,970 --> 00:20:06,350
Yes.

360
00:20:06,350 --> 00:20:10,040
In this half, Nankatsu won't attack.

361
00:20:10,040 --> 00:20:12,890
Tsubasa and Misaki haven't even moved.

362
00:20:12,890 --> 00:20:16,280
Are their leg injuries that bad?

363
00:20:16,280 --> 00:20:17,900
Or did they--

364
00:20:17,900 --> 00:20:22,150
Captain! Nankatsu's plan is to defend in the first half!

365
00:20:22,150 --> 00:20:23,150
What?

366
00:20:23,150 --> 00:20:27,780
They plan to attack in the second half by resting Tsubasa and Misaki!

367
00:20:27,780 --> 00:20:29,160
So you figured it out.

368
00:20:29,160 --> 00:20:30,550
Exactly!

369
00:20:30,550 --> 00:20:32,380
Only 30 seconds left.

370
00:20:32,380 --> 00:20:35,170
We'll keep defending like this, Hyuga!

371
00:20:35,170 --> 00:20:38,300
I don't care what your plan is!

372
00:20:38,300 --> 00:20:42,000
We'll attack in the first half and the second half, that's all!

373
00:20:42,000 --> 00:20:46,130
We'll keep attacking and seize victory!

374
00:20:46,820 --> 00:20:48,420
I'm coming, Wakabayashi!

375
00:20:48,420 --> 00:20:50,140
Hyuga-kun passes midfield!

376
00:20:50,140 --> 00:20:52,140
Stop him! Block his shot!

377
00:20:52,140 --> 00:20:55,990
I'll stop it. No matter what, I won't concede in this half.

378
00:20:55,990 --> 00:21:01,530
Otherwise, our entire plan will have been in vain!

379
00:21:01,530 --> 00:21:02,530
Wakabayashi-kun!

380
