Hyuga-kun doesn't shoot.

381
00:21:07,170 --> 00:21:11,910
Goalkeeper Wakashimazu-kun comes running!

382
00:21:11,910 --> 00:21:13,640
Come on, Wakashimazu!

383
00:21:13,640 --> 00:21:16,630
You still have plenty of strength.

384
00:21:16,630 --> 00:21:20,420
And that powerful shot of yours to rival me!

385
00:21:23,170 --> 00:21:24,170
Wakabayashi-kun!

386
00:21:24,170 --> 00:21:25,930
So it's you, Wakashimazu!

387
00:21:25,930 --> 00:21:29,430
If I were to shoot at the goal, I'd shoot there too!

388
00:21:30,660 --> 00:21:32,350
H-He saved it!

389
00:21:32,350 --> 00:21:33,060
What?!

390
00:21:34,580 --> 00:21:36,060
Wakabayashi...

391
00:21:36,060 --> 00:21:39,400
Wakabayashi-kun catches this shot firmly too.

392
00:21:39,400 --> 00:21:43,320
And the referee blows the whistle to end the first half of additional extra time.

